[metadata]
Name:Rules pilot 345 - Overload does not target
Goal:Survive
Turns:1
Difficulty:Easy
Description:It is your first main phase. You have Mizzium Mortars (overload {3}{R}{R}{R}) in hand with six red mana floating. The opponent is at 20 life and controls Gladecover Scout (hexproof) and Grizzly Bears. Destroy both of the opponent's creatures this turn.
Rule:authored-overload-hexproof | Overload replaces the word target with each, so the overloaded spell has no targets (CR 702.96a-b) and hexproof does not stop it: overloaded Mortars deals 4 to each creature you don't control; cast normally it can target only the Bears
